FlexPPI

The invariant point attention design is an independent PyTorch implementation
inspired by the Apache-2.0 licensed AlphaFold and Ibex/OpenFold structure
modules:

  https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold
  https://github.com/prescient-design/ibex

No pretrained AlphaFold or Ibex weights are redistributed by this project.
ESM weights, when enabled, retain their upstream licenses. The local ATLAS
dataset is distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0; users are responsible for checking
the licenses of all training data and model weights for their intended use.

